		<p>Shark-fin antenna transmit and receive signals such as AM/FM and GPS. Additional signals are sent and received according to vehicle options.</p>
		<ul id="e01910">
			<li>
				<p>Be careful of antenna damage by checking the height of the vehicle before entering low-ceiling spaces such as automated parking lots or automated washing machines.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Be careful not to contact the antenna when loading cargo on the roof rack. Antenna transmission/reception performance may be degraded.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
